  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p>The Ankarres Sapphire is a valuable gem that has passed through many hands over the years, including the hands of the bounty hunter 4-LOM around the time of the Battle of <span class=\"new\" title=\"Yavin IV (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvWWF2aW5fSVY/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Yavin</span>. Legend has it that the Ankarres Sapphire possesses incredible healing powers that, when used as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_Crystal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber Crystal\">Lightsaber Crystal</a>, grants the wielder similar powers. Moreover, the legends say that only those who employ the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Light_Side\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Side\">Light Side</a> of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> can use the Ankarres Sapphire effectively. </p><p>If you wield a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> attuned with the Ankarres Sapphire and you have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> of 0, you gain a +5 Force bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> checks or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks made to activate the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vital_Transfer\" title=\"Vital Transfer\">Vital Transfer</a></i> Force Power. </p><p>The Ankarres Sapphire is thought to be unique, although it's possible that other such sapphire exist. </p>",
